us about something.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_11","text":"If there are some absurd rumors going around about someone close to you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_12","text":"and everyone else is actually buying into it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_13","text":"what would you do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_14","text":"What kind of rumors?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_15","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_16","text":"For example,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_17","text":"how Zwei's been cheating all this time,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_18","text":"or that Rei is actually 200 years old.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_19","text":"You know, stuff like that. LOL.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_20","text":"That's just ridiculous.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_21","text":"I know, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_22","text":"How can people","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_23","text":"believe such absurd rumors?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_24","text":"It doesn't make any sense at all!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_25","text":"Most rumors tend to be like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_26","text":"So what would you do,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_27","text":"Teacher?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_28","text":"I'd believe in my friend, of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_29","text":"Exactly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_30","text":"That's what I thought.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_31","text":"But when I asked Zwei for proof that she didn't cheat,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_32","text":"she refused","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_33","text":"and just said that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_34","text":"I should trust her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_35","text":"So I did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_36","text":"She seems kinda peeved at the whole thing,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_37","text":"but that's not my fault, is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_38","text":"That sounds about right.","jump":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_40"},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_39","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_39","text":"Maybe she's just feeling a bit awkward.","jump":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_43"},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_40","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_41","text":"So it has to do with her attitude, then?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_42","text":"Hmm... what should I do about that temper of hers...","jump":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_50"},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_43","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_44","text":"By asking her for proof, Zwei feels that you're doubting her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_45","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_46","text":"She probably doesn't appreciate having to defend herself, least of all to you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_47","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_48","text":"Oh, okay!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_49","text":"I get it... I think, hehe.","jump":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_50"},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_50","text":"Anyway, I know I've been asking you a lot of random questions.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_51","text":"So thanks for answering.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_52","text":"If I'm ever bored or have a question, I'll send you a message here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_53","text":"Wouldn't it be better to simply send me a private message?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_54","text":"No way! Private messages are too public.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_55","text":"If you create a secret group chat, you won't receive any notifications,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_56","text":"so you don't have to worry about anyone else seeing it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_57","text":"I don't want anyone to know about this. It's kind of embarrassing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_58","text":"Lol, got it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_59","text":"Hehe :D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_01_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_01_60","text":"See you later, Teacher.","jump":null}],"chat":true}